[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Codex starts a per-user background server automatically. No rc service is needed.
Use --no-daemon to run with an embedded server instead.

The background server keeps its own copy of the Codex package. After upgrading
Codex with pkg, refresh that copy as your regular user:

  codex app-server daemon update --from-cli

This asks for confirmation and restarts a running server, interrupting active
work. Upstream automatic binary updates are disabled on FreeBSD.
EOM
}
{ type: upgrade
  message: <<EOM
If you have used the Codex background server, refresh its private package copy
as your regular user after upgrading:

  codex app-server daemon update --from-cli

This asks for confirmation and restarts a running server, interrupting active
work. Upstream automatic binary updates are disabled on FreeBSD; use pkg.
EOM
}
]
